        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "35483239-1604-560e-9997-94d2349a1a6e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Son of the Pink Panther; The Return of the Pink Panther; The Pink Panther; A Shot in the Dark; Inspector Clouseau; Down by Law; Night on Earth; Coffee and Cigarettes\n- People: Burt Kwouk; Herbert Lom; Graham Stark; Claudia Cardinale; Roberto Benigni; Peter Sellers; Jim Jarmusch\n- Roles: Inspector Clouseau; Cato\n- Topics: Pink Panther film series\n\nFacts:\n- The Pink Panther is the original 1963 film in the Pink Panther film series.\n- Peter Sellers returned to the role of Inspector Clouseau in The Return of the Pink Panther after last playing the role in A Shot in the Dark (1964).\n- Peter Sellers had declined to reprise Inspector Clouseau in Inspector Clouseau (1968).\n- Roberto Benigni collaborated with Jim Jarmusch in Down by Law (1986), Night on Earth (1991), and Coffee and Cigarettes (2003).\n- Son of the Pink Panther is a 1993 continuation of The Pink Panther film series.\n- Roberto Benigni portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in Son of the Pink Panther (1993).\n- Son of the Pink Panther also features Pink Panther regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk, and Graham Stark, as well as Claudia Cardinale from the original 1963 film.\n- Burt Kwouk was a British actor known for playing Cato in the Pink Panther films.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "9af699c3-9e23-5869-bf98-cdc5a282fe52",
        "text": "Page: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Son of the Pink Panther (1993) is a continuation of \"The Pink Panther\" film series.\nPage: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Also in this film are \"Panther\" regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk and Graham Stark and a star of the original 1963 film, Claudia Cardinale.\nPage: Burt Kwouk. Sentence: Herbert Tsangtse \"Burt\" Kwouk, OBE ( ; ; 18 July 1930 – 24 May 2016) was a British actor, known for his role as Cato in the \"Pink Panther\" films.\nPage: Roberto Benigni. Sentence: He also portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in \"Son of the Pink Panther\" (1993) and has collaborated with filmmaker Jim Jarmusch in three of his films: \"Down by Law\" (1986), \"Night on Earth\" (1991) and \"Coffee and Cigarettes\" (2003).\nPage: The Return of the Pink Panther. Sentence: The film stars Peter Sellers, returning to the role of Inspector Clouseau, for the first time since \"A Shot in the Dark\" (1964), after having declined to reprise the role in \"Inspector Clouseau\" (1968).",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
      },
